<hr>

<p>At 1.6 kg (3.5 lbs) the POD is light enough to approach and climb alpine big walls in light and fast style. Move fast and sleep where you want.</p>
<p>&nbsp;<img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0091/3784/8400/files/NV080016-Edit_1024x1024.png?v=1612831939" alt="pod lightweight"></p>



