          <div>


              <section data-aos="none">
                <div>



<hr>

<p>The POD is constructed from a TPU laminated 235D high tenacity nylon composite fabric and further reinforced with patches in high abrasion areas.</p>
<p>&nbsp;<img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0091/3784/8400/files/wideGIFsmall.gif?v=1615229473" alt=""></p>

<div><p>The POD uses the same technology as inflatable river rafts allowing it to bounce over rocks and sharp edges.</p></div>


                </div>

              </section>


          </div>

          <div>



              <section data-bgset="

    //cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0091/3784/8400/files/IMG_0567-Edit-2_180x.jpg?v=1613089980 180w 85h,


